{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Her bars.</b> The places where the mountains were cut there, from the root of ויקצב עץ (and he hewed timber)." "<b>And the earth.</b> Its bars were behind me — so that I could not go out to be upon the earth." "<b>Yet You brought up my life from the pit.</b> Figuratively, concerning his soul, which is truly his life."], :book :jonah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Jonah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=19&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:07:11.023046039Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}